    "notes": "All 12 views inspected. Simple shouldered clay vase with a real hollow neck and an unglazed brown interior visible in the top view, plus a correctly finished foot ring in the bottom view. Clean even topology in the wireframe. The 4 is for materials: the matte off-white surface is very plain with only faint mottling, so it reads flat under diffuse light.",
    "limitations": [
      "Very plain matte white surface with little tonal variation.",
      "Interior is unglazed brown clay, which is visible from directly above."
